OL,3,ADriving test waits fall to two-year low
OL,4,A- but still average 20 weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FWaiting times for driving tests have
OL,7,Fdropped below 20 weeks for the first
OL,8,Ftime since November 2024, according to
OL,9,Fofficial figures.
OL,11,FBut learner drivers in September still
OL,12,Fhad to wait an average of 19.7 weeks,
OL,13,For around five months, for a practical
OL,14,Ftest.
OL,16,FThe Driver and Vehicle Standards Agency
OL,17,F(DVSA) has been trying to cut waiting
OL,18,Ftimes and clear a backlog which began
OL,19,Fduring the Covid pandemic in 2020.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
