OL,3,ADriving test waits fall to two-year low
OL,4,A- but still average 20 weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommenting on the agency's progress,
OL,7,Fone driving instructor told the BBC: "I
OL,8,Fdon't think this is anything to boast
OL,9,Fabout."
